WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:05.850
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: No unsupervised access

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:07.930
to SCP-387!

00:00:07.930 --> 00:00:12.910
SCP-387, or The Living Lego, is a miraculous
find.

00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:18.520
It is a tub of seemingly ordinary Lego bricks
that, when built into a shape by human hands,

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:21.790
comes to life and even develops sentience.

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:26.550
Of course, Dr. Bright can never let a cool
thing just exist without wreaking some havoc

00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:31.850
with it, and decided to build a tiny lifelike
model of SCP-682.

00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:37.280
We have no idea how he built it so fast, or
why it took military-grade explosives to blow

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:42.960
apart a creature made from plastic blocks,
but it was a mess to clean up, and Agent Johnson

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:45.010
will never get his big toe back.

00:00:45.010 --> 00:00:49.370
If Dr. Bright is so desperate to play with
Legos, he'll have to stick to the non-magic

00:00:49.370 --> 00:00:49.390
kind.

